{"id":60534,"date":"2026-08-19T11:27:05","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T10:27:05","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-02T21:33:56","modified_gmt":"2026-09-02T20:33:56","slug":"night-run-urbano","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/night-run-urbano\/","title":{"rendered":"Night Run Urbano 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Night Run Urbano 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Night Run Urbano 2026<\/strong> convida os amantes do desporto a percorrer as ruas hist\u00f3ricas, monumentos e escadarias de <strong>Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>, sob a envolv\u00eancia \u00fanica da noite. Numa organiza\u00e7\u00e3o solid\u00e1ria dos <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos<\/strong>, o evento alia o desafio f\u00edsico de uma corrida em piso diversificado ao conv\u00edvio e apoio \u00e0 corpora\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa conta com a prova competitiva de <strong>Trail Urbano (10 km)<\/strong> e a participativa <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (6 km)<\/strong>, ambas com partida e meta no quartel dos bombeiros. O percurso alterna entre cal\u00e7ada, terra batida e alcatr\u00e3o, exigindo o uso obrigat\u00f3rio de lanterna frontal e culminando num refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 20:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos, Leiria<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail Urbano (10 km) e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (6 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos<\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Urbano<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:00 \u2022 Misto \/ Escadarias<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 3 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:15<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 11\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 12.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 23\/09)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida do Night Run Urbano 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 3 de outubro de 2026, com partida no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos: Trail Urbano (10 km) \u00e0s 20:00 e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (6 km) \u00e0s 20:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de lanterna frontal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, cada participante deve levar a sua pr\u00f3pria lanterna frontal operacional, pois o evento decorre em per\u00edodo noturno por ruas, escadarias e caminhos sem ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o cont\u00ednua.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tipos de piso encontrados no percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 misto e diversificado, incluindo asfalto, cal\u00e7ada tradicional, terra batida e escadas de acesso a monumentos de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip de cronometragem, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido final no quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos e seguro desportivo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s das plataformas QueroIr.pt e TotalCrono at\u00e9 23 de setembro de 2026, com acompanhamento de detalhes no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Night Run Urbano 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-03\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rio e local de partida do Night Run Urbano 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 3 de outubro de 2026, com partida no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos: Trail Urbano (10 km) \u00e0s 20:00 e Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (6 km) \u00e0s 20:15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de lanterna frontal?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, cada participante deve levar a sua pr\u00f3pria lanterna frontal operacional, pois o evento decorre em per\u00edodo noturno por ruas, escadarias e caminhos sem ilumina\u00e7\u00e3o cont\u00ednua.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os tipos de piso encontrados no percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tra\u00e7ado \u00e9 misto e diversificado, incluindo asfalto, cal\u00e7ada tradicional, terra batida e escadas de acesso a monumentos de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal com chip de cronometragem, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido final no quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Figueir\u00f3 dos Vinhos e seguro desportivo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s das plataformas QueroIr.pt e TotalCrono at\u00e9 23 de setembro de 2026, com acompanhamento de detalhes no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":60538,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[38,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-60534","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-figueiro-dos-vinhos-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\